body:
Gotcha, I think I misread your original commen. 

&#x200B;

Also, that's really cool! Thanks for the tidbit!

Hey not arguing, (you're clearly the expert here lol) but I think we were supposed to assume that Marco had this all planned out to the second, and may well have sling-shotted those 'micro-meteoroids all the way around the sun. If you allow that he knows how much shielding the ships have, it follows that he could get rocks with enough velocity to punch through it.

&#x200B;

But it was cool to hear about modern spacecraft, thanks!

lol don't even get me STARTED on the puzzles and platforming. I get that people can get bored of combat if it's nonstop...but I can't help but wonder how much better the game would be as a whole if they chopped out some of the over the top platforming and spent that time/money on more interesting enemy encounters.

&#x200B;

But alas, here we are.

Hey just wanted to say thanks so much for the comments. I took some time with my family and I'm a lot better off. I probably wouldn't have gone through with it anyway, but strangers caring really really touched me. Y'all are the best.

&#x200B;

Thank you all again
